        "（III）取 \\(z=\\sqrt{2(x-1)(y-1)}\\ (x,y\\ge1)\\)，则 \\(z_x=\\frac{y-1}{z},z_y=\\frac{x-1}{z}\\)，\\(dS=\\sqrt{1+z_x^{2}+z_y^{2}}\\,dxdy=\\frac{1}{z}\\sqrt{(x-1)^{2}+(y-1)^{2}+2(x-1)(y-1)}\\,dxdy=\\frac{x+y-2}{z}dxdy\\)。",
