        "\\(M=\\int_{1}^{3}dx\\int_{1}^{4-x}(x+y-2)dy=\\int_{1}^{3}\\left(-\\frac{x^{2}}{2}+x+\\frac32\\right)dx=\\frac{8}{3}\\)。"
